DESCRIPTION:Explore the art of drawing with a twist at our BDSM Life Drawi
 ng Class. Hosted by artist Stella-May &amp\; Come As You Are. +18 Welcome 
 to the Bondage Life Drawing Class at Come As You Are! Canada’s fave plea
 sure\, health + education shop. Voted Toronto’s best! Feminist &amp\; fr
 iendly to a fault. Join us for a unique experience where you can unleash y
 our creativity while exploring the art of bondage. Our talented models wil
 l strike captivating poses for you to sketch. Whether you&#x27\;re a seaso
 ned artist or a beginner\, this class is open to all skill levels. Don&#x2
 7\;t worry if you&#x27\;ve never tried bondage art before - our friendly i
 nstructor will guide you through the process. Grab your sketchbook and pen
 cils\, and get ready for a fun and inspiring session! No one will be turne
 d away for lack of funds. For accessibility\, accommodation and further in
 formation\, contact lilin@comeasyouare.com We do not supply any drawing eq
 uipment. The class is dimly lit to illuminate the model. If you require an
 y accommodation\, please contact us. https://www.comeasyouare.com/ Masks a
 re strongly encouraged at this time. Please note that this life drawing cl
 ass features nude models for the purpose of artistic study. The session is
  intended for adults only (18+). By attending\, participants acknowledge a
 nd accept the presence of unclothed models in a respectful\, professional 
 environment. ‍
LOCATION:Come as You Are\, 254 Augusta Ave
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/bondage-life-drawing
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
