  film: @oldlesbiansfilm 🥹 This one is truly special. I’m so\, so hono
 ured to be able to help show this story in Toronto. As always\, we’ll be
  hosting at @threedollarbill.parkdale and each ticket comes with popcorn. 
 Thank you to everyone who helps make these nights a reality\, to all my fr
 iends and loved ones who come support and help out along the way\, to the 
 people I see often\, to the young queers and the elder dykes who come to t
 he showings. Thank you for last night. It means a lot to me to help facili
 tate this space\, these gatherings. I hope you all meet up outside of Dyke
 umentary Night. I hope you all find community and connection in this room 
 and beyond it. I hope to see you all more and more and more. Thank you for
  being here. See you next month ❤️🤍🩷 Tickets available at the li
 nk 🔗 in bio on instagram nas always 🎟️ ‍
