DESCRIPTION:we invite you to a sapphic reading social! 📖when: Tuesday J
 uly 14\, 2026 📔where: @bampothouse of tea! 📖what to bring: a gently-
 used book\, wrapped either at home or on-site at our wrapping station 📔
 tickets are PWYC at the link in bio 📖when you arrive with your wrapped 
 book\, you’ll be given a label and asked to write a description of the b
 ook’s themes without spoiling the title. Then\, the books will be placed
  on a shelf and readers will have the chance to peruse the selection. For 
 the first hour\, guests will settle in\, order iced tea\, cocktails\, or f
 ood\, and talk about queer literature using curated conversation prompts. 
 We also invite you to decorate and design your own bookmarks. As the event
  progresses\, we’ll announce the winners of bookish giveaways from vendo
 rs like @anotherstorybookshop !!! Around 8:30\, the book exchange will tak
 e place :) ‍
LOCATION:Bampot\, 201 Harbord St
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/sapphic-literary-social
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
