UID:72c1353792255cea88811e372bb52e5f@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:[Redacted] presents “Cold Blooded&quot\; DJs: DJ Deseo (Rio 
 De Janeiro\, Brazil)\, Widdows95\, Rose Hips\, and Valeroo Lighting: Tiger
  Lightning Dance Performance: Sylv Myst as Swamp Witch 12:30 Flyer Art: St
 acie Ant x Widdows95 Door staff: Marjie Dress Code &amp\; Theme: Cold Bloo
 ded: mermaids\, aliens\, reptilians\, vampires\, medusa\, your ex... _____
 ____________________________________ Dj Deseo is the aka of Camilo Tapia F
 lores\, chilean artist\, documentarian\, and Dj who currently is part of t
 he electronic scene in Rio de Janeiro He performs vibrantly in the undergr
 ound circuit. where he blends sounds\, territories\, and urban experiences
 . He has played at some of Rio&#x27\;s main parties like Domply\, V de Via
 dão\, Climão\, Soga Beach\, Onda\, Fish\, The Edge Rio\, and hosts his o
 wn party\, &quot\;Deseo Latino\,&quot\; one of the most iconic parties dur
 ing Rio Carnival. His work also includes Di sets on radio stations like Fu
 ntion FM!\, Manteiga Radio\, Fun Fun Mix by Djs Pareja\, and Tectonica Rá
 dio. He started djing in 2018\, but before taking the leap into mixing\, h
 e was already an active member of the electronic community and culture in 
 Santiago\, Chile Within the musical style represented by Dj Deseo\, he has
  managed to create a sound that connects with various house rhythms\, such
  as garage\, new york\, chicago\, and deep\, which he mixes with pop music
 \, emotive tunes\, and above all. latin rhythms\, always infused with nost
 algia and a distinct queer identity. Beyond his musical career\, Dj Deseo 
 is also an activist in the fight against the spread of HIV and Aids in the
  communities and spaces he inhabits. including Rio&#x27\;s underground sce
 ne _________________________________________ [Redacted] exists as an open\
 , carefree space for punks\, ravers\, queers\, and allies - featuring care
 fully curated lineups of local and international DJs. Entry at the door is
  $25\, so we encourage purchasing tickets in advance online. Our first 15 
 tickets are always $15. PLUR. Discrimination or harassment towards others 
 based on protected characteristics will not be tolerated. Tell one of the 
 staff if you are made to feel uncomfortable - this is an enforced safe spa
 ce. Please do not take photos of others without their permission. Venue an
 nounced the day of the event Follow us on IG @redactedparty ‍
LOCATION:TBA\, Address TO BE ANNOUNCED
