UID:8712f261a37c829d48ac2a19022fdffb@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:/lineup DJ Godfather AceMo Kush Jones 999ADJ Chinelo Rhythm Op
 en Air returns July 25 for the second edition of our three-part summer ser
 ies exploring the full spectrum of contemporary dance music in an open-air
  setting. For the second chapter\, we dive into the raw energy of electro\
 , ghetto tech\, and club music — spotlighting artists pushing the bounda
 ries of contemporary dance music through innovation\, experimentation\, an
 d deep-rooted connections to underground culture. Leading the soundtrack f
 or the day is Detroit legend DJ Godfather\, one of the founding architects
  of ghetto tech and a pivotal figure in shaping the sound of dance floors 
 across the globe. Joining him are two of the most exciting voices in conte
 mporary club music: New York&#x27\;s Kush Jones and Brooklyn&#x27\;s AceMo
 \, artists whose work seamlessly connects house\, techno\, electro\, jungl
 e\, footwork\, and beyond into distinctly modern club experiences. Represe
 nting Toronto are local favourites 999ADJ and Chinelo\, two selectors help
 ing define the city&#x27\;s next generation of underground dance music cul
 ture. Together\, the lineup reflects the spirit of Rhythm Open Air: bringi
 ng together global innovators and local talent for a full-day gathering ce
 ntered around discovery\, community\, and the future of the dancefloor. Se
 e you in the courtyard at 131 McCormack on July 25. ‍
LOCATION:131 McCormack\, 131 McCormack Street
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/rhythm-open-air-dj-godfather-acemo-kush-jo
 nes
