 ergence\, luscious libations and sonic sensations. Local breeds a plenty\,
  our time together will be guided by the pristine plumage of several city 
 species\, with the special migratory return of a rare Pittsburgher Yinzer.
  Don your flamboyant plumage\, or come as you are\, and make BIRDBATH a sa
 tiating stopover spot on your sultry summer migration. Super early BIRD\, 
 early BIRD\, and regular BIRD tickets available now until each flock has f
 lown! Higher price at the door and may be very limited. Show your support 
 and gobble those tickets up fast\, fluffies! Rain or shine! Saturday\, Jul
 y 25 3-10PM Soleil 1251 Dundas Street West ‍
