DESCRIPTION:You sold out the first one\, and I want everyone to see this m
 ovie\, so I’m doing a second screening of @oldlesbiansfilm 🥹🥹🥹 
 Tickets for July 28 on sale now. As always\, comes with popcorn and a chan
 ce to make new lesbian friends in a low stakes environment. This movie is 
 truly gorgeous\, and I can’t wait to show it to you all. Thank you @oldl
 esbiansfilm and @threedollarbill.parkdale for working with me and helping 
 me do a SECOND date for this. See you there for our first ever double movi
 e month in July :’) this is the post-Pride feel good film you need 🩷 
 . . . . . . Toronto lesbian\, Toronto lesbians\, Toronto wlw\, queer Toron
 to\, gay Toronto\, movies in Toronto\, sapphic Toronto\, things to do in T
 oronto\, Toronto culture\, queer culture Toronto\, Toronto life ‍
LOCATION:Three Dollar Bill\, 1592 Queen Street West
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/a-dykeumentary-night-screening-old-lesbian
 s-2
